CHROMA XXL x DRIPS - 11.09.2025

After teaming up a few times with artists from the DRIPS collective, CHROMA is closing out this amazing summer season at @oxi_club by uniting both collectives for one unforgettable night.

DRIPS will be rocking the O Floor stage, while CHROMA brings you a mix of international and local talents on the X Floor. A night that brings us close, sweating & moving as one, all for the love of sexy grooves.

Can’t wait to rock this with you, fam.

